## The starting point.

Coastal Internal Medicine launched as a brand-new independent internal medicine practice in Vista, CA - going up against practices with 30+ year local histories. The site had **no schema markup, no entity signal, and four near-duplicate service pages.** To an AI engine, the practice was close to invisible.

## What we built.

- **Brand around the physician.** Physician-led video content for social became the spine of the brand - the doctor himself, not stock footage.
- **A technical foundation for AI.** We rebuilt the site with **MedicalBusiness, Physician, FAQPage, and MedicalWebPage schema,** an entity-signaling structure, and patient-intent FAQ content written for AI extraction.
- **Service pages rebuilt.** The four near-duplicate pages became distinct service pages carrying medically-reviewed bylines.
- **Compliant by construction.** All advertising and lead tracking were built and maintained **HIPAA compliant** - HIPAA-compliant advertising and lead tracking for a healthcare practice.

## What happened.

- **Highest-performing AI visibility of any internal medicine practice in North County San Diego.**
- **Ranked #1 in organic search for "internist Vista" and "internal medicine Vista" (September 2026)** - against practices with 30+ year local histories.
- **New patients arrive each week** saying an AI assistant recommended the practice by name.

> A brand-new practice, built to be found. We put the physician at the center, gave the engines a structure they could read, and did it all on a HIPAA-compliant foundation.
